From 91259a1c2a07b3252b63b5b28bfcfb8dbc1ccaf6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gezim <25499045+gezimos@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 19:06:32 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Kompakt: the picker options turn a page per swipe

Wallpaper & style scrolled its options with the finger, and the previews
collapsed with them through the MotionLayout swipe: a smear of repaints on
e-ink. The options sit in a PagedScrollView (a NestedScrollView that takes
no drag; Twelve\x27s page gesture) and the transition has no OnSwipe. A page
down first collapses the previews (progress 1), then turns the options a
viewport at a time; a page up at the top brings the previews back
(progress 0), each in one step.

Change-Id: I5b631306613b5200861441cdfab3ede434ef90cf
---
 res/layout/fragment_customization_picker2.xml |  4 +-
 res/xml/customization_picker_layout_scene.xml |  7 +-
 .../ui/CustomizationPickerFragment2.kt        | 18 ++++
 src/com/kompakt/eink/PageGestureListener.java | 84 +++++++++++++++++++
 src/com/kompakt/eink/PagedScrollView.java     | 54 ++++++++++++
 5 files changed, 159 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)
 create mode 100755 src/com/kompakt/eink/PageGestureListener.java
 create mode 100644 src/com/kompakt/eink/PagedScrollView.java

